     "text": "Write a reflection titled “Integrity When Others Misunderstand You.”\nConsider:\n• The accusations made against Stephen.\n• The difference between honest disagreement and deliberate misrepresentation.\n• How to respond when your words or intentions are misunderstood.\n• Why truth, fairness, and accountability matter in Christian community.\n• One practical commitment you will make to protect your own integrity.\nIf you discuss the assignment with a peer, use a hypothetical example or a non-sensitive personal experience. Avoid spreading unverified allegations about other people."
