     "text": "Prepare a reflection titled “Available for the Next Assignment.”\nUse Acts 8:26–27 to discuss:\n• The instruction Philip received.\n• Why his willingness to travel was important.\n• The difference between serving a crowd and helping one individual.\n• How believers can remain available without neglecting their existing responsibilities.\n• One practical step you can take to become more attentive to opportunities to serve.\nConclude with a short prayer asking God for wisdom, attentiveness, and a willing heart."
