    "assignment": {
     "title": "Assignment — Preparing and Sending People for Service",
     "text": "Think about a need or opportunity for Christian service beyond your immediate community.\nWrite a plan that addresses the following:\nThe mission: What need or opportunity have you identified?\nThe people: Who might be equipped to serve in this area?\nThe preparation: What knowledge, skills, spiritual maturity, or practical experience would be helpful?\nThe discernment: How can Scripture, prayer, wise counsel, and the wider community help evaluate the proposed work?\nThe support: What practical, spiritual, or financial support might be required?\nThe accountability: How will the people involved communicate their progress and responsibilities?\nThe outcome: What would faithful service look like, regardless of public recognition or immediate results?\nConclude by identifying one practical way your community could help prepare or support someone for service."
    }
