     "Giving another opportunity requires wisdom. Encouragement should be balanced with an honest assessment of a person’s readiness and the responsibilities involved.",
     "People should not be reduced to their weakest moment. Christian communities should consider the whole person rather than allowing one past event to determine every future judgment.",
     "God can work through people who are still developing. Christian service involves growth, correction, learning, and increasing maturity."
