   "2. Understand the importance of learning and teaching the Word of God.",
   "3. Describe the relationship between the Holy Spirit and Christian discipleship.",
   "4. Recognise the difference between God’s power and practices that oppose His truth.",
   "5. Explain why the Gospel can create opposition when it challenges established interests.",
   "6. Understand the importance of perseverance during missionary work.",
   "7. Identify lessons from the account of Eutychus.",
   "8. Explain Paul’s warnings and instructions to the Ephesian elders.",
   "9. Apply principles of faithful leadership, spiritual growth, and accountability to everyday Christian life.",
   "Whole-topic Discussion Questions",
   "1. Why did Paul return to strengthen believers rather than concentrating only on reaching new places?",
   "2. What can we learn from Apollos about the relationship between passion, knowledge, and humility?",
   "3. Why was Paul’s encounter with the disciples in Ephesus important for their understanding of the Christian faith?",
   "4. What does Paul’s teaching in the Hall of Tyrannus reveal about the importance of consistent biblical instruction?",
   "5. What distinction does Acts 19 make between God’s power and attempts to use spiritual practices for personal advantage?",
   "6. Why did the Gospel create conflict with Demetrius and the silversmiths?",
   "7. How can Christians remain courageous without becoming reckless when facing opposition?",
   "8. What does the account of Eutychus teach about fellowship and the value of each person in a Christian community?",
   "9. What can we learn from Paul’s determination to complete his ministry despite uncertainty and suffering?",
   "10. Why did Paul warn the Ephesian elders to take heed to themselves before shepherding others?",
   "11. How can Christian communities guard against distorted teaching while maintaining humility and love?",
   "12. What practical steps can believers take to strengthen one another in faith?",
   "13. How can a peer discipleship network encourage spiritual maturity without making one person the centre of everyone’s growth?",
   "14. What does Paul’s farewell teach us about preparing others to continue God’s work?",
   "15. Which lesson from Paul’s third missionary journey do you most need to apply in your life, and why?",
   "Final Assignment — Building a Community That Strengthens Believers",
