     "The authority of Jesus Christ is central to the Christian message. Paul acted in the name of Jesus, and the account attributes the girl’s deliverance to that action.",
     "Compassion should influence how we respond to suffering. Christians should be concerned about people who are exploited, oppressed, or treated without dignity.",
     "Doing what is right may challenge powerful interests. Paul’s action disrupted a profitable arrangement and provoked opposition."
