     "Doing what is right may carry a cost. Paul and Silas suffered because their actions disrupted a profitable arrangement.",
     "Authority should be exercised with justice. Decisions affecting people’s freedom and dignity should not be driven by prejudice, anger, or pressure from a crowd.",
