     "It was in this atmosphere that Paul stood among them.",
     "He reminded the passengers that they should have listened to his earlier warning and avoided the danger of setting out from Crete. However, he did not spend the moment simply blaming them for their decision.",
     "Instead, he brought them a message of hope.",
