     "Faithfulness can leave a lasting influence. Paul’s teaching and example strengthened others and helped the gospel advance.",
     "Do not measure spiritual progress only by visible success. Paul was still under guard, yet his ministry continued to bear witness to Christ.",
     "Every generation has a responsibility to continue the mission. Acts ends with the gospel being proclaimed, reminding readers that the work of witness and discipleship continues beyond the pages of the book."
