    "assignment": {
     "title": null,
     "text": "My Soldier, Athlete, and Farmer Plan\nCreate a practical plan based on Paul’s three illustrations.\nSoldier — Focus\n• Identify one important responsibility.\n• Name two distractions that interfere with it.\n• Choose one way to manage those distractions.\nAthlete — Integrity\n• Identify one area where you need greater discipline or honesty.\n• Write down one practical standard you will follow.\nFarmer — Patience\n• Identify one area of growth that requires time.\n• Choose a consistent action you can practise for the next 30 days.\nReview your plan with a trusted peer if you wish, and decide how you will evaluate your progress."
    }
