     "Do not let the failures of others determine your faithfulness. Paul continued his mission even after experiencing abandonment.",
     "The Lord’s presence provides hope when human support is limited. Paul found strength in God’s faithfulness even when others were absent.",
     "People who serve others also need encouragement. Churches and peer communities should make practical care, friendship, and support part of their shared responsibility."
