     "Yet being closely related to Jesus did not automatically mean that James understood who Jesus was.",
     "During Jesus’s earthly ministry, many people struggled to understand His identity. Some heard His teaching but rejected Him. Others witnessed His miracles yet failed to recognize the significance of His mission.",
