     "Our speech should reflect the dignity of people made in God’s likeness. We cannot consistently honour God while deliberately using our words to degrade others.",
     "Godly wisdom produces humility and peace. James describes heavenly wisdom as pure, peaceable, gentle, merciful, and full of good fruit.",
     "Peace does not require dishonesty. Christian wisdom seeks peace while remaining committed to truth, fairness, and integrity."
