     "Some people claimed to speak through the Spirit, while others presented teachings that did not agree with the apostolic message concerning Jesus Christ.",
     "John understood that spiritual language alone was not enough to establish the truthfulness of a message.",
     "He therefore instructed believers not to believe every spirit but to test the spirits to determine whether they were from God.",
     "His concern was not to encourage suspicion toward every person who spoke about spiritual matters. Rather, he wanted believers to develop discernment so that they would not be misled by false teaching.",
