     "Thomas experienced a moment in which he struggled to believe that Jesus had risen. His story shows how his response changed when he encountered the risen Christ and confessed Him as Lord and God.",
     "But Christian faith is not merely one moment of emotional certainty. It is a continuing relationship of trust and obedience.",
     "Believers may experience seasons of strength and seasons of struggle. They may encounter questions they cannot immediately answer or circumstances they cannot fully understand.",
