     "Timothy also needed to understand that spiritual maturity would not develop automatically simply because he held a leadership responsibility.",
     "He had to keep watch over his life and teaching. His personal conduct and public instruction were connected.",
     "If he taught truth but neglected his own character, his ministry would be weakened. If he pursued personal holiness while neglecting sound teaching, he would also fail in an important responsibility.",
     "Paul therefore called Timothy to persevere in both areas.",
