     "text": "Read Acts 9:1–9 and write a personal reflection titled “When Jesus Interrupts Our Direction.” Describe the difference between pursuing a goal through personal conviction and pursuing a purpose shaped by Christ. End with a prayer asking God to correct your direction wherever necessary."
