     "text": "Read Acts 9:17–19 and Romans 6:3–4.\nWrite a reflection on the meaning of a new beginning in Christ.\nInclude:\n• One attitude or behaviour you need to leave behind.\n• One truth from Scripture you want to live by.\n• One spiritual habit you want to develop.\n• One person who can encourage you in your growth.\n• One measurable action you will take during the next seven days.\nIf you have not been baptised and would like to understand Christian baptism, prepare questions to discuss with a trusted Christian leader."
